 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xp7hFMcUkv8Q7kNvwFpC4W8&_nc_oc=AdoZIocOsTObwEW7shq7WhvFi6M-mp7Hzjj9rK7pKMZoYGM8CkevGtbKhXz4I9opQcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG1buwcBZulWj9fIsdNi14CDlM7PeFxMHGI_C1Jz0CMPQ&oe=6A95D381"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIZ7aUDEtTQQ7kNvwGb2IQK&_nc_oc=AdqheIT23fSkZ_7YssB8Yhvt_1H6XsN6isG9EqjkIB0y2sh56RImxcCo0KoVmHNgHO8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0PXrcSET-062teIS0JCOSTRlnT96NzWyj8rfauecUmg&oe=6A95E0E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PLKSlCnXtYQ7kNvwFpo1PS&_nc_oc=AdoRt7_TmLfNtU7j6e9YZ6Bb-uDHW-zmuYrSKkHkitEX66HPswv6m9MlBBUuJiJQqnY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG1Ix6ER9suPUpp4Ux3K9ekqcdxZdPbXYKubQKd6Icdag&oe=6A95B29C"}, {"fil